{"title":"1987 AJHSME Problems/Problem 13","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1987_AJHSME_Problems/Problem_13&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Which of the following <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Fraction\" title=\"Fraction\">fractions</a> has the largest value?\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/0/3/a03c4c6c8ec66b311508cc8fe9912a160a325556.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\text{(A)}\\ \\frac{3}{7} \\qquad \\text{(B)}\\ \\frac{4}{9} \\qquad \\text{(C)}\\ \\frac{17}{35} \\qquad \\text{(D)}\\ \\frac{100}{201} \\qquad \\text{(E)}\\ \\frac{151}{301}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"398\" height=\"38\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution\">Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1987_AJHSME_Problems/Problem_13&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Notice that <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/f/5/0f52f1841180566ff540b5d6f2d47623740ef4b5.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{3}{7} &lt; \\frac{3}{6} = \\frac{1}{2}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"90\" height=\"38\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/f/3/ff32c36db4545b18c6e2948cb7dc815a6cf042f1.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{4}{9} &lt; \\frac{4}{8} = \\frac{1}{2}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"90\" height=\"38\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/5/3/d536d69af21f56aa55c2e7349310172e02941b8b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{17}{35} &lt; \\frac{17}{34} = \\frac{1}{2}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"108\" height=\"38\" />, and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/8/3/e83e513811a66573d39c9447243b6b08a550ee86.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{100}{201} &lt; \\frac{100}{200} = \\frac{1}{2}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"126\" height=\"38\" />, but <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/1/4/a1422bc8aaf12f5261ac1ac28f23319de3a0ab87.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{151}{301} &gt; \\frac{151}{302} = \\frac{1}{2}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"126\" height=\"38\" />.  Since <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/8/b/f8b878a9992533f34bb74164111b0de0a0006d84.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\boxed{\\textbf{(E)}\\ \\frac{151}{301}}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -19px\" width=\"77\" height=\"49\" /> is the only answer choice greater than <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/f/9/2f960094315d60883495f9b74148e17487ee9584.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{1}{2}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"15\" height=\"38\" />, it must be the largest.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_Also\">See Also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1987_AJHSME_Problems/Problem_13&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: See Also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:80%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1987_AJHSME\" title=\"1987 AJHSME\">1987 AJHSME</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1987_AJHSME_Problems\" title=\"1987 AJHSME Problems\">Problems</a></b> • <b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1987_AJHSME_Answer_Key\" title=\"1987 AJHSME Answer Key\">Answer Key</a></b> • <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://www.artofproblemsolving.com/Forum/resources.php?c=182&amp;cid=42&amp;year=1987\">Resources</a>)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Preceded&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1987_AJHSME_Problems/Problem_12\" title=\"1987 AJHSME Problems/Problem 12\">Problem 12</a></b>\n</td>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Followed&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1987_AJHSME_Problems/Problem_14\" title=\"1987 AJHSME Problems/Problem 14\">Problem 14</a></b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"3\" style=\"text-align:center;\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1987_AJHSME_Problems/Problem_1\" title=\"1987 AJHSME Problems/Problem 1\">1</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1987_AJHSME_Problems/Problem_2\" title=\"1987 AJHSME Problems/Problem 2\">2</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1987_AJHSME_Problems/Problem_3\" title=\"1987 AJHSME Problems/Problem 3\">3</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1987_AJHSME_Problems/Problem_4\" title=\"1987 AJHSME Problems/Problem 4\">4</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1987_AJHSME_Problems/Problem_5\" title=\"1987 AJHSME Problems/Problem 5\">5</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1987_AJHSME_Problems/Problem_6\" title=\"1987 AJHSME Problems/Problem 6\">6</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1987_AJHSME_Problems/Problem_7\" title=\"1987 AJHSME Problems/Problem 7\">7</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1987_AJHSME_Problems/Problem_8\" title=\"1987 AJHSME Problems/Problem 8\">8</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1987_AJHSME_Problems/Problem_9\" title=\"1987 AJHSME Problems/Problem 9\">9</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1987_AJHSME_Problems/Problem_10\" title=\"1987 AJHSME Problems/Problem 10\">10</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1987_AJHSME_Problems/Problem_11\" title=\"1987 AJHSME Problems/Problem 11\">11</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1987_AJHSME_Problems/Problem_12\" title=\"1987 AJHSME Problems/Problem 12\">12</a> <b>•</b> <a class=\"mw-selflink selflink\">13</a> <b>•</b> <a